      "created_at": "2026-08-03T16:05:28Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-03T16:11:37Z",
      "body": "Hi @rithviknishad @Jacobjeevan @snehasnair2002 , I'd like to work on this issue.\n\nThe frequency dropdown uses the `Autocomplete` component in `src/components/ui/autocomplete.tsx`. The `CaretSortIcon` (arrow icon) is rendered as a decorative element with `pointer-events` not explicitly set, so clicks on it don't propagate to the `PopoverTrigger` button that opens the dropdown.\n\nIn other dropdowns in the app (e.g. `Select`), the trigger wraps the entire clickable area including the icon. Here, the `CaretSortIcon` sits outside the trigger's click area.\n\nProposed fix: Add `pointer-events-none` to the `CaretSortIcon` so clicks pass through to the underlying trigger button, matching the pattern used in other dropdown components.\n\nETA: 1 day after assignment",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
